{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T02:04:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T02:04:37Z","body":"I just tested the issue.\n\nThe bug is now resolved, although I do get the warning \"cancel_pending_functions: Canceling suspended execution of \"_ready\" due to a script reload\". \n\nIf this is the fix to the problem it kind of seems like a bad way of fixing the bug, because the code I changed wasn't even related to the _ready function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305126936/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305257832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101059#issuecomment-3305257832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101059","id":3305257832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FAjto","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T03:10:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T03:10:21Z","body":"> If this is the fix to the problem it kind of seems like a bad way of fixing the bug, because the code I changed wasn't even related to the _ready function.\n\nBut this bug is about the `await` keyword (the one in the `_ready` function) as the problem is when the engine try to continue the script execution after a reload. So the point is not where you changed the code, is where the `await` is and trigger a script reload while the engine is awaiting to continue the script execution. Also, this issue is not related with the plugin system per se as the same problem can be triggered outside the plugin system. See: #97053, #86362 \n\nFor a more technical explanation about the bug, see: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100750#issuecomment-2639759952","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3305257832/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]